{"sha": "db83e19da7c36fd5d9e976837bf345b072890ef88844dab573329c9e4dd4defc", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:g12:complex:rootsofunity}", "方程 $z^n = 1$ 恰有 $n$ 个解：", "\\[", "\\omega_k = \\eu^{2\\iu k\\pi/n}, \\qquad k = 0, 1, \\dots, n-1 .", "\\]", "它们的像为单位圆内接正 $n$ 边形的顶点，", "且当 $n \\geq 2$ 时，它们的和为 $0$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "每个 $\\omega_k$ 满足 $\\omega_k^n = \\eu^{2\\iu k\\pi} = 1$，且它们", "两两互异，因为它们的辐角属于 $\\intco{0}{2\\pi}$。", "反之，若 $z^n = 1$，则 $\\abs z^n = 1$，于是 $\\abs z = 1$（正", "实数），且 $z = \\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，其中 $n\\theta \\equiv 0 \\pmod{2\\pi}$，", "\\emph{即} $\\theta = \\frac{2k\\pi}{n}$；将 $k$ 模 $n$ 约化，", "便得某个 $\\omega_k$。各顶点等角间隔 $\\frac{2\\pi}{n}$，", "故为正 $n$ 边形。最后，取 $\\omega = \\omega_1$，", "且 $\\omega \\neq 1$，由等比求和公式得", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\omega_k = \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\omega^k", "= \\frac{\\omega^n - 1}{\\omega - 1} = 0 . \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.7]", "  \\draw[->] (-1.3,0) -- (1.45,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-1.3) -- (0,1.4) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw[gray] (0,0) circle (1);", "  \\draw[omDef] (0:1) -- (72:1) -- (144:1) -- (216:1) -- (288:1) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[->,omThm,thick] (0.3,0) arc (0:72:0.3);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (36:0.52) {$\\frac{2\\pi}{5}$};", "  \\fill (0:1) circle (1pt) node[below right] {$1$};", "  \\fill (72:1) circle (1pt) node[above right] {$\\omega$};", "  \\fill (144:1) circle (1pt) node[above left] {$\\omega^2$};", "  \\fill (216:1) circle (1pt) node[below left] {$\\omega^3$};", "  \\fill (288:1) circle (1pt) node[below right] {$\\omega^4$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 五次单位根，$\\omega = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/5}$：", "为单位圆内接正五边形的顶点，", "（见\\cref{exo:g12:complex:10}）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}", "立方单位根为 $1$、$j = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/3} =", "-\\frac12 + \\iu\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$ 及 $\\conj j = j^2$，满足", "$1 + j + j^2 = 0$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{复数与平面几何}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[几何对应]\\label{prop:g12:complex:geometry}", "设点 $A, B, C, D$ 的对应复数分别为 $a, b, c, d$（$a \\neq b$，", "$c \\neq d$）。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由对应复数为 $t$ 的向量确定的平移为 $z \\mapsto z + t$。", "  \\item 中心为 $\\omega$（对应复数）、角为 $\\theta$ 的旋转为", "        $z \\mapsto \\omega + \\eu^{\\iu\\theta}(z - \\omega)$。", "  \\item 中心为 $\\omega$、比为", "        $k \\in \\R^*$ 的伸缩（位似）变换为 $z \\mapsto \\omega + k(z - \\omega)$。", "  \\item $\\dfrac{d - c}{b - a}$ 的模为 $\\dfrac{CD}{AB}$，辐角为", "        向量 $\\vect{AB}$ 与 $\\vect{CD}$ 之间的夹角。特别地，", "        $AB \\perp CD$ 当且仅当 $\\frac{d-c}{b-a}$ 为纯虚数，", "        且 $A, B, C$ 共线（$C \\ne A$，$C\\ne B$），当且仅当", "        $\\frac{c-a}{b-a} \\in \\R$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "(1)、(3) 只是重述坐标公式。对 (2)，映射", "$w \\mapsto \\eu^{\\iu\\theta} w$ 将模乘以 $1$，并将辐角加上 $\\theta$，", "即绕原点旋转角 $\\theta$；再经把 $\\omega$ 映为 $0$ 的平移作共轭，", "即得一般中心的情形。对", "(4)，商的模与辐角分别作差", "（见\\cref{thm:g12:complex:expform}）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:complex:1}", "将下列复数化为代数形式：", "$(3 - 2\\iu)(1 + 4\\iu)$, \\quad $\\dfrac{2 + \\iu}{1 - \\iu}$, \\quad", "$\\iu^{2027}$.", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:complex:2}", "在 $\\C$ 中解方程：(a) $z^2 - 4z + 13 = 0$；(b) $z^2 + z + 1 = 0$。", "在两种情形中验证两解互为共轭复数，并求它们的乘积。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:complex:3}", "将 $z_1 = -1 + \\iu$、$z_2 = \\sqrt3 - \\iu$ 化为指数形式，", "并先以指数形式、再以代数形式计算 $\\dfrac{z_1}{z_2}$，由此推出", "$\\cos\\dfrac{11\\pi}{12}$ 的精确值。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:complex:4}", "描述满足下列条件的点 $M$（对应复数为 $z$）所构成的集合：", "(a) $\\abs{z - 2} = \\abs{z + \\iu}$；\\quad", "(b) $\\abs{z - 1 - \\iu} = 3$；\\quad", "(c) $\\dfrac{z - 1}{z + 1}$ 为纯虚数。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:complex:5}", "利用棣莫弗公式与二项式定理，将 $\\cos 3\\theta$", "表示为 $\\cos\\theta$ 的多项式，并将 $\\sin 3\\theta$ 用", "$\\sin\\theta$ 表示。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}